# 📊 Dataset

This folder contains the dataset collected for the research project:

**"A Study on the Influence of Product Placement on Impulse Buying Behaviour Among College Students in Retail Stores."**

## 📌 Dataset Information

| Particular | Details |
|---|---|
| Sample Size | 50 responses |
| Data Collection Method | Structured Questionnaire |
| Target Respondents | College Students |
| Number of Study Variables | 30 |
| Data Analysis Software | IBM SPSS Statistics |

## 📋 Variables Included

The dataset contains:

- Product placement-related variables
- Impulse buying behaviour-related variables
- Opinion-based Likert-scale variables

## 📏 Likert Scale Coding

The opinion-based questions were coded as:

| Value | Response |
|---:|---|
| 1 | Strongly Disagree |
| 2 | Disagree |
| 3 | Neutral |
| 4 | Agree |
| 5 | Strongly Agree |

## 🔬 Variables Used for Statistical Analysis

The following variables were selected for the statistical analyses:

| Analysis | Variables |
|---|---|
| Pearson Correlation | Q7 & Q19 |
| Spearman Rank Correlation | Q13 & Q20 |
| Linear Regression | Q11 → Q19 |
| Multiple Regression | Q7, Q11 & Q17 → Q19 |
| One-Sample T-Test | Q30 |
| Paired-Samples T-Test | Product Placement Score & Impulse Buying Score |

## 🔐 Data Privacy

The dataset is provided for academic and portfolio purposes.

Personally identifiable information such as names, email addresses, phone numbers, registration numbers, or other identifying information should not be included in the publicly shared dataset.

